      "diff": "@@ -135,7 +135,7 @@ Architecture: any\n Section: devel\n Depends: ${misc:Depends}, omniidl (>= 4.0.1-2), libpcap0.8-dev,\n  libglib2.0-dev, python3:any, python3-ply, esnacc,\n- libwireshark-dev, libwiretap-dev\n+ libwireshark-dev, libwiretap-dev, libuiqt-plugin-dev\n Description: network traffic analyzer - development tools\n  Wireshark is a network \"sniffer\" - a tool that captures and analyzes\n  packets off the wire. Wireshark can decode too many protocols to list\n@@ -288,3 +288,14 @@ Depends: ${misc:Depends}\n Description: Qt-based UI plugin library -- shared library\n  QtUIPlugin, part of the Wireshark project, is a library that allows one to\n  create UI extensions through menu options\n+\n+Package: libuiqt-plugin-dev\n+Section: libdevel\n+Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libwsutil-dev, libwireshark-dev,\n+ libuiqt-plugin0 (= ${binary:Version})\n+Architecture: any\n+Description: Qt-based UI plugin library -- development files\n+ QtUIPlugin, part of the Wireshark project, is a library that allows one to\n+ create UI extensions through menu options\n+ .\n+ This package contains the static library and the C header files.\n",
